        "en": "Homotopy Class of Paths",
        "zh-CN": "道路同伦类"
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "snl": "variable(__list__(Type.annotation(@X,Type),Type.annotation(@x,X),Type.annotation(@y,X)),def(Path.Homotopic.Quotient(x,y), , ))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "en",
        "values": {
          "en": "The **homotopy class** $[f]$ of a path $f$ is its class under the homotopy relation with fixed endpoints; the set of these classes is the quotient of the paths from $x_0$ to $x_1$ by that relation (Hatcher Proposition 1.2, p. 26).",
          "zh-CN": "道路 $f$ 的**同伦类** $[f]$ 是它在固定端点同伦关系下的等价类；这些类的集合是从 $x_0$ 到 $x_1$ 的道路对该关系的商（Hatcher 命题 1.2，第 26 页）。"
        }
      }
    },
